OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FVariable amounts of cloud with
OL,6,Fsome sunny spells and a few showers,
OL,7,Fthese mainly across the west and
OL,8,Fnorth. Becoming largely dry later with
OL,9,Fincreasing sunny spells in the
OL,10,Fafternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA mainly dry evening with
OL,13,Fsome sunny spells, though there is a
OL,14,Fchance of the odd light passing
OL,15,Fshower. Becoming largely dry
OL,16,Fovernight, especially across eastern
OL,17,Fareas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
