OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FMost places dry with bright or
OL,6,Fsunny spells, however the odd light
OL,7,Fshower can't be ruled in the morning
OL,8,For early afternoon. Gentle winds.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,11,FBecoming rather unsettled with the
OL,12,Frisk of rain or showers. The best of
OL,13,Fthe drier and brighter conditions will
OL,14,Fbe across western areas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
